          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Key takeaways:</strong></span>\n<ol>\n<li>Lower RMSE doesn't guarantee good model (check coverage too!)</li>\n<li>PI Coverage should match target (80% \u2192 80% coverage)</li>\n<li>Residuals should be white noise (random, centered at 0)</li>\n<li>Uncertainty width should vary by time-of-day</li>\n<li>Monitor weekly; retrain if metrics degrade</li>\n</ol>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">For the theory behind all of this, see <a href=\"../../docs_src/theory/index.md\"><code>docs_src/theory/index.md</code></a>.</span></span>"
